  "userGuideTitle": "EXODUS VENUE DASHBOARD: USER GUIDE",
  "guideOverviewTitle": "1. OVERVIEW",
  "guideOverviewContent": "Exodus is a professional attendance monitoring tool. Its purpose is to track the flow of visitors through a specific entrance or exit. Unlike a standard 'clicker,' it manages two values simultaneously to provide a real-time view of venue safety and capacity.",
  "guideOverviewEntered": "Entered: The cumulative total of all people who have passed through the gate. This number only goes up and represents the 'Total Flow.'",
  "guideOverviewInside": "Still Inside: The current headcount remaining within the venue. This number goes up when people enter and down when they leave.",
  "guideDashboardTitle": "2. THE MAIN DASHBOARD (HOME SCREEN)",
  "guideDashboardContent": "This is the primary screen where the supervisor will spend 99% of their time.",
  "guideDashboardHeader": "Branded Header: Features the Exodus logo. Long-pressing this logo provides a quick shortcut to the Help screen.",
  "guideDashboardLocation": "Location Row: Displays the name of the current gate (e.g., 'North Entrance'). This ensures that if multiple phones are in use, the logs are correctly attributed.",
  "guideDashboardCapacity": "Capacity Row: Displays the 'Max Capacity' or safety limit for the area.",
  "guideDashboardEnteredCard": "Entered Card (Blue): Large display of the total entries.",
  "guideDashboardInsideCard": "Still Inside Card (Green/White): Large display of the current headcount.",
  "guideSafetyTitle": "Visual Safety Indicators",
  "guideSafetyContent": "The Still Inside card uses a 'heat-map' logic to warn the supervisor of potential overcrowding without them having to read the numbers:",
  "guideSafetyTransition": "As the headcount approaches the Max Capacity, the card will smoothly transition from a neutral white to a graduated red.",
  "guideSafetyThreshold": "This warning begins when the remaining space is either 10 people or 2% of the total capacity (whichever is greater).",
  "guideSafetySignal": "A deep red card is a signal to the supervisor to slow down or stop entries.",
  "guideInputTitle": "3. INPUT MODES (HOW TO COUNT)",
  "guideInputContent": "At the top of the dashboard, there are two icons to switch the input method based on the situation.",
  "guideInputButtonTitle": "A. Button Mode (Icon: Tapping Finger)",
  "guideInputButtonTapEntered": "Tap [+] on the blue card for an entry.",
  "guideInputButtonTapInside": "Tap [-] on the green card for an exit.",
  "guideInputButtonBestFor": "Best for: Steady, manageable traffic where high precision is required.",
  "guideInputSwipeTitle": "B. Swipe Mode (Icon: Swiping Hand)",
  "guideInputSwipeUp": "Swipe UP anywhere on the screen to record an entry.",
  "guideInputSwipeDown": "Swipe DOWN anywhere on the screen to record an exit.",
  "guideInputSwipeBestFor": "Best for: Fast-moving crowds or 'rushes' where the supervisor needs to keep their eyes on the visitors rather than the screen.",
  "guideCorrectionTitle": "4. CORRECTION AND NAVIGATION",
  "guideCorrectionContent": "Mistakes happen, especially during busy shifts. Exodus provides two layers of correction:",
  "guideCorrectionUndo": "Undo (Top-Left Icon): Tapping the curved arrow instantly reverts the very last action taken (count or edit).",
  "guideCorrectionManual": "Manual Edit (Keypad): Long-pressing either the Entered or Still Inside card opens a numeric keypad. This allows the supervisor to type in a confirmed headcount (e.g., after a manual floor check).",
  "guideLogTitle": "5. LOG HISTORY AND REPORTING",
  "guideLogContent": "Every action is recorded with a timestamp. To access the log, tap the Gear Icon and select View Log, or use the Long-press shortcut on the Gear icon.",
  "guideLogSearch": "Search: Use the bar at the top to filter for specific events like 'RESET' or 'MANUAL EDIT.'",
  "guideLogDelete": "Delete: Individual entries can be removed by long-pressing them (requires confirmation).",
  "guideLogExport": "Exporting: You can share the logs as a CSV (for Excel) or a Formatted PDF.",
  "guideLogPreview": "Preview: The 'Preview Report' option allows you to see the professional PDF layout before you send it via WhatsApp or Email.",
  "guideSessionTitle": "6. SESSION MANAGEMENT",
  "guideSessionResetTitle": "Resetting the Day",
  "guideSessionResetContent": "To clear the counters for a new shift or event, select Reset Session from the Gear menu.",
  "guideSessionResetExport": "The app will first ask if you want to Export the data so you don't lose the previous session's records.",
  "guideSessionResetConfirm": "A final confirmation is required before the app wipes the counters to 0 and clears the log history.",
  "guideSessionShutdownTitle": "Shutdown",
  "guideSessionShutdownContent": "Selecting Shutdown creates a final log entry to close the digital paper trail and exits the app cleanly.",
